  <result aggregation-status="1" type="1">
   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Annual Output Results</narrative>
   </title>
   <indicator aggregation-status="1" ascending="0" measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Coordinated implementation and monitoring of the implementation of the Roadmap for a sustainable solution to the illegal possession, misuse and trafficking of SALW/firearms and their ammunition in the Western Balkans.</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building upon the Decision (CFSP) 2018/1788, this component will ensure the continuation of coordination and monitoring of the implementation of the Roadmap.</narrative>
    </description>
    <baseline year="2023">
     <comment>
      <narrative xml:lang="EN">During the first three years of implementation at least seven regional narrative and Key Performance Indicators reports have been published, providing a measurable and up to date account on the progress of implementation of the Roadmap.</narrative>
     </comment>
    </baseline>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2023-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2023-12-31"></period-end>
     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">Organization of up to six regional Roadmap coordination meetings; 2 per year.
1.2. Organisation of local coordination meetings (up to 36 in total); 12 per year.

1.3. Number of biannual regional monitoring reports on the implementation of the Western Balkans SALW Control Roadmap;.

1.4. Final review of the Roadmap;

1.5. Maintenance of an online platform to ensure proper outreach and visibility of Roadmap through a number of actions.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">Two regional Roadmap coordination meetings organized (9th&amp;10th)

Two rounds of local coordination meetings held in 2023 (2 local coordination meetings per jurisdiction, 12 local meetings held in total)

Two consolidated Progress Reports finalized (9th and 10th)

rogress made in the implementation of the Roadmap was reviewed at a High-Level Meeting on Countering Firearms Trafficking in Southeast Europe Implementing the Specific Actions for South East Europe of the EU Action Plan on Firearms Trafficking 2020-2025, including the Implementation of the Roadmap for comprehensive Small Arms and Light Weapons control in the Western Balkans. 

Roadmap visibility and outreach continued to be pursued through regular updating of the dedicated online platform, and through meetings with key stakeholders.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
   </indicator>
   <indicator aggregation-status="1" ascending="0" measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthened interregional cooperation, knowledge exchange and information-sharing on arms control.</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">This component will facilitate the interregional information sharing, knowledge exchange, replication of good practices and lessons learnt though provision of technical advice, meetings, workshops and study visits.</narrative>
    </description>
    <baseline year="2023">
     <comment>
      <narrative xml:lang="EN">Interregional cooperation, knowledge exchange and information-sharing on arms control established</narrative>
     </comment>
    </baseline>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2023-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2023-12-31"></period-end>
     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical and advisory support provided: Advisory support for interregional cooperation, knowledge exchange and information sharing provided four times per year.

Meetings, workshops or study visits organized: one per year.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical and advisory support provided: Advisory support for interregional cooperation, knowledge exchange and information sharing provided.
8  Regional Roadmap Coordination meetings</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
   </indicator>
   <indicator aggregation-status="1" ascending="0" measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Capacity building of law enforcement services of Moldova and Ukraine for countering illicit trafficking and possession of firearms</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Provision of advisory support, equipment and training for law enforcement services in countering illicit arms trafficking in Moldova and Ukraine, based on assessment methodologies developed and implemented for the Western Balkans under EU CD 2018/1788</narrative>
    </description>
    <baseline year="2023">
     <comment>
      <narrative xml:lang="EN">Limited capacites of law enforcement services of Moldova and Ukraine for countering illicit trafficking</narrative>
     </comment>
